{{also|Tänzen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|tanzen}}. The adapted onset ''t-'' in [[Upper German]] dialects (and standard German) proves that the word was not borrowed directly from {{etyl|fro|de}} {{m|fro|dancer}} (the ultimate source), but via {{etyl|dum|de}} {{m|dum|dansen}} and [[Central German]].

